  "notes": "USAGE: {統計|とうけい} refers to both statistical data and the academic field of statistics.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {統計|とうけい}を{取|と}る (to compile statistics)\n- {統計|とうけい}によると (according to statistics)\n- {統計|とうけい}{的|てき}に (statistically)\n- {統計|とうけい}{調査|ちょうさ} (statistical survey)\n\nCOMMON COMPOUNDS:\n- {統計|とうけい}{学|がく} (statistics - academic field)\n- {統計|とうけい}{データ} (statistical data)\n- {統計|とうけい}{資料|しりょう} (statistical materials)\n- {人口|じんこう}{統計|とうけい} (population statistics)",
